{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":1400,"row":{"en":"One day, Esteban was listening to the radio when he heard a song that he thought Marcela would like.","wo":"Benn bis, Esteban doon deglu radio ba ci yàgg mu dégg benn way bumu jàpp ni dina neex Marcela.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss, Esteban done deglou radio ba thi yagg mou degg benn way boumou diap ni dina nekh Marcela.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1401,"row":{"en":"He taught that all beings are caught in a cycle of birth, death, and rebirth, and that this cycle is perpetuated by our attachments to things in the world.","wo":"Daf nu jàngal ni amul mbindéef bu mucc ci cycle u juddu, dee, ak judduwaat, te li waral cycle boobu dul musa dakk mooy linu teg sunu bakkan ci mbiri àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaf gnou diangal ni amoul mbindef bou mouthie si cycle u dioudou, dé, ak dioudouwat, té li waral cycle bobou doul meussa dakk moy linou teg sounou bakane thi mbiri addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1402,"row":{"en":"It takes time and effort to build a lasting relationship.","wo":"Fàww ngeen liggéey lu yàgg balaa diggante bi di mëna yàgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFaw ngen liguey lou yague bala diguenté bi dina meuna yague.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1403,"row":{"en":"Amara was a quick learner, and she soon became very skilled at the art.","wo":"Amara dafa neex xel, yàggul dara mu wane xarañteem ci art bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmara dafa nekh hel yaggoul dara mou wané kharantém thi art bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1404,"row":{"en":"Another important custom is the funeral ceremony, which is held for a deceased person.","wo":"Beneen xew-xew bu am solo bi mooy dëj, ñu koy defal ku génn àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeneen hew hew bou am solo bi moy deuj, gnou koy defal kou guenn addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1405,"row":{"en":"Refrigerators and freezers are typically rated by their total cooling capacity.","wo":"Frigo yi ak congelatër ñu ngi leen di faral ci nattee ci seeni kàttani seddal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFrigo yi ak congelateur gnoungui lén di faral thi naté thi séni katani seddal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1406,"row":{"en":"Khan Academy recently introduced guided meditation practices.","wo":"Bu yàggul dara Khan Academy dugal ni ñuy defee meditation ci tegtal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBou yaggoul dara khane academy dougal ni gnuy defé méditation si tegtal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1407,"row":{"en":"It has also played a role in shaping social and political thought.","wo":"Amal na itam liggéey bu am solo ci joxe xalaat ci yor réew ak askan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmal na itam liguey bou am solo si diokhé khalaat si yor réw ak askane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1408,"row":{"en":"The building was not up to code and the employees were being exposed to dangerous chemicals. We had no choice but to shut the firm down.","wo":"Batimaa bi amul matuwaay yi war te dafa amna lu mëna lor wérgi-yaramu liggéeykat yi. Mënu nu ludul tëj entreprise.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBatimaa bi amoul matuwaay yi war té dafa amna lou meuna lor wergui yaramou ligueyekat yi. Meunou gnou loudoul teuth entreprise bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1409,"row":{"en":"I have a lot of work to do, but I can't seem to get started.","wo":"Dama bari liggéey, te mënu ma tàmbali ba leegi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama bari liguey té meunouma tambali ba legui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1410,"row":{"en":"Birthdays are a time to celebrate the day you were born.","wo":"Bisu aniwerseer mooy bis bi ngay màggal sa bisu juddu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBissou aniwerser moy biss bi ngay magal sa bissou dioudou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1411,"row":{"en":"One of the most popular social media influencers in the world is Kim Kardashian.","wo":"Kenn ci influensër yi gëna siiw ci àdduna bi mooy Kim Kardashian.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKenn thi influensseur yi geuna siw thi addouna bi moy Kim kardashian\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1412,"row":{"en":"If you have a problem, then solve it.","wo":"Su ngeen amee jafe-jafe, ngeen lijjanti ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou ngéne amé diafé diafé ngéne lidieunti ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1413,"row":{"en":"Work is worship is a powerful principle that can transform our lives and our relationships.","wo":"Liggéey jaamu Yàlla, njàngale la mu am solo mu mëna soppi sunu dundu ak sunu diggante ak nit ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiguéy diamou yalla, ndiangalé la mou ame solo mou meuna sopi souniou doundou ak souniou diguenté ak nitt gni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1414,"row":{"en":"We are the ones who are haunted by the past, and who live in fear of the future.","wo":"Nun la sunu demb toppu, te nun noo ragal liy am ëlëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNioun la souniou demb topou té nioun nio ragal li ame euleuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1415,"row":{"en":"Another is to install pollution controls on factories and power plants.","wo":"Leneen mooy ñu fexe nu ñuy saytoo polusioŋ bu usine yi ak sàntraalu kuuraŋ yi di def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLénéne moy gnou fékhé ni niouy sayto pollution bou usine yi ak centrale courant yi di def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1416,"row":{"en":"People get all worked up about it, and they don't even know why.","wo":"Ñépp a mer te kenn mënu la wax luko waral.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGneup a mer té kene meuneu la wakh louko waral.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1417,"row":{"en":"I love you so much","wo":"Dama la bëgg lool","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama la beugue loool rk\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1418,"row":{"en":"They were all evenly matched, and it was anyone's race.","wo":"Daanaka ñooy ñépp a tolloo doole, te ku nekk mënoon na raw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaanaka gnoy nieup a tolou dolé té kou nek meunone na raw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1419,"row":{"en":"The first major civilization in Ethiopia was the Aksumite Empire, which flourished from the 1st century BC to the 8th century AD.","wo":"Siwilisasioŋ bu mag bu njëkk ci Ethiopie mooy Empire Aksumite, amoon ci diggante xarnu 1 balaa JC ba xarnu 8 ginaaw JC.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCivilisation bou mag bou ndieuk thi Ethiopie moy Empire Aksumite, amone thi diguenté kharnou 1 balaa JC ba kharnou 8 guinaw JC.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1420,"row":{"en":"For example, enclosures and machine tools must have strict temperature control for the precise machining of metal.","wo":"Ci misàal, resintos ak juntuwaayu masin yi denoo wara am seytu tamperatiir ngir ligéeyu defaràat wen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi missal resinto ak djuntuwayou masin yi daniou wara ame seytou température nguir ligueyou defarat wéne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1421,"row":{"en":"The gun went off, and the runners sprinted out of the blocks.","wo":"Dóor nañu pistole bi, atlet daal di génne blok yi daw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoor nagnou pistolé bi, atlét daal di guéné blok yi daw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1422,"row":{"en":"Lily's father helped her to free the turtle, and the two of them returned to the river.","wo":"Pàppa ji jàppale Lily ñu xettali mbonaat bi, ba noppi ñoom ñaar ñu dellu ca dex ga.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPapa dji diapalé Lily gnou kheutali mbonate bi ba noppi gnom gnaar gnou dellou ca deuth ga.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1423,"row":{"en":"I'm telling you, this is going to be the funniest thing ever, said Tom.","wo":"Tom daal di wax, Maala ko wax, doo musa gis lu reetaanloo nii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTom daldi wakh, Maala ko wakh do meusseu guiss lou reytanlo nii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1424,"row":{"en":"To hold in your heart the beauty and the pain, the joy and the sorrow, the light and the darkness.To see the world as it is, and to love it nonetheless.","wo":"Nga tëye ci sa xol taaru metit, bànneexu naqar, leer gi ci lëndëm. Jàppee àdduna ni nga ko gisee, te du tere nga bëgg ko ci sa xol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNga teuye ci sa khol taarou metite, banehekhou nakhar, leer gui ci leundeum. Diappé addouna ni nga ko guissé té dou tereu nga beug ko ci sa khol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1425,"row":{"en":"Sometimes they went to bed together, straight away, nothing said.","wo":"Yenn saa yi ñu and tëri, ci saasi, duñu wax dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYen sayi gnou ande teuri thi sasi dougnou wakh dara\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1426,"row":{"en":"[Grandmother smiles and goes back to knitting.","wo":"[Maam ju jigéen ji daal di muuñ ba noppi wéy di ràbb.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMame djou djiguéne dji daldi mougne ba nopi way di rab.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1427,"row":{"en":"Keep your sink shining and free of dirty dishes at all times.","wo":"Feexal sa evier di seet saa yu nekk, du am benn ndap bu tilim.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFékhale sa évier di séte sa you nek dou ame bene ndape bou tilime\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1428,"row":{"en":"Mrs. Harold has outlined an ambitious program of promotion and events.","wo":"Mme Harold tëral na prograamu fësal mbir ak xew-xew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMme Harold teural na programme bou fessal mbir ak hew hew.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1429,"row":{"en":"The capital and largest city in Malawi is Lilongwe.","wo":"Dëkk bi gëna rëy di kapitaalu Malawi mooy Lilongwe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeuk bi geuna reuy di kapitaalou malawi moy lilongwe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1430,"row":{"en":"You have no idea how the real world works, and you think that everything should be handed to you on a silver platter.","wo":"Xamoo leen dara ci ni àdduna di doxee, teg ci ngeen yaakaar ni lu ngeen soxla da ngeen di toog mu fekksi leen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhameu léne dara thi ni aduna di dokhé tégg thi ngéne yakar ni lou ngéne sokhla da ngéne di togue mou fekksi léne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1431,"row":{"en":"Customers are liable for any import or customs duties on arrival of the rug in their country.","wo":"Klian yi benne juuti bu aju ci indi gi wala duwan warulen ci bu tapi yi aggsee seen reew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKlian yi bene juuti bou aju thi indi gui wala douwane waroulene thi bou tapi yi agsé sen rew.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1432,"row":{"en":"I continued to make my way around the festival, sampling everything from charcuterie to chocolate.","wo":"Ma wéyal sama doxantu ci biir festival bi, ñam li dalee ci yàpp yi ba ci sokolaa yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa weyal sama dohantou si biir festival bi, gniam li dalé si yap yi ba si sokola yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1433,"row":{"en":"As I watched it being hauled away, I felt a pang of regret.","wo":"Bima gisee ñu koy yóbbu, sama xol jeex ma tàmbali réccu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBima guissé gnou koy yobou sama khol diekh ma tambali réthiou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1434,"row":{"en":"On the Earth, the first living things began to appear.","wo":"Mbindéef yi tàmbalee di feeñ ci kaw Suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbindef yi tambalé di fen si kaw souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1435,"row":{"en":"Regular maintenance of the notice board itself is essential.","wo":"Toppato saasune bu tablo tafukaay bi ci boppam mooy li am solo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTopato sassouné bou tableau tafoukay bi thi boppam moy li ame solo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1436,"row":{"en":"After we had finished cleaning the vegetables, we put them in the smoker.","wo":"Bi nu noppee ci raxas lujum yi, nu dugal leen ci fumoir bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnou nopé thi rakhass loudioum yi, gnou dougal léne thi fumoir bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1437,"row":{"en":"The dog bit her multiple times on the head and neck, and she died at the scene.","wo":"Xaj bi daal di koy màtt, màtt yu bari ci bopp ak ci baat, mu daal di faatu ca barab ba.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhaj bi daldi koy matt, matt you bari thi bopp ak thi baat, mou daldi faatou thia barab ba.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1438,"row":{"en":"We need to get out of here, Mum says. Now.","wo":"Sama yaay ni, Nanu daw joge fi, leegi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama yay né, nanou daw diogué fi, légui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1439,"row":{"en":"It means being honest, trustworthy, and ethical.","wo":"Loolu mooy dëggu, wóor, am looy bañ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLolou moy deugu woor am loy bagn rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1440,"row":{"en":"Here are some specific examples of how translation has benefited businesses: * A small business that sells handmade jewelry translated its website into Spanish, French, and German.","wo":"Yenn misaal a ngi nii yuy wane ni tekki làkk amee njariñ ci liggéey: * Benn entreprise buy jaay takkaay yuñ defaree loxo dafa tekki làkku sitwebam ci Español, Francais, ak Allemand.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYenn misal a ngi nii youy wané ni tekki làkk amé njariñ si liggéey: * Benn entreprise bouy jaay takkaay yougn defaré lokho dafa tekki lakou sitwebam si espagnol, francais, ak allemand.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1441,"row":{"en":"He knew that he had to do something to help, but he didn't know what.","wo":"Mu xamni amna lumu wara def ngir indi ci saafara waaye xamul lan la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou khamni amna loumou wara def nguir indi thi safara wayé khamoul lane la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1442,"row":{"en":"Foot orthotics helps them maintain the correct feet alignment, reduce pain, prevent injury, and enhance efficiency.","wo":"Ortotiku tànk dafay jubbanti tànk yu maaseul jub, wàññi metit, moytu nga gaañu, gëna dëgaral tànk yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nOrtotiku tank dafay djoubanti tank you massel dioub, wagnii metite, moytou nga ganou, geuna deugaral tank yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1443,"row":{"en":"At least I know how to drive!","wo":"Ba tay, waaye mën naa dawal!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa tay wayé meun naa dawal !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1444,"row":{"en":"While some vegetarians avoid all animal products, including dairy and eggs, others may consume dairy or eggs but not meat.","wo":"Yenn vegetarien yi duñu lekk lenn lu bawoo ci baayima, lu ci melni lu am meew ak nen, ñeneen ñi dañuy lekk lu am meew wala nen waaye duñu lekk yàpp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYéne vegetarien yi dougnou lekk len lou bawoo thi bayima, lou ci melni lou am méw ak nen, gnénéne gni daniouy lekk lou am méw wala nen wayé dougnou lekk yap.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1445,"row":{"en":"B: There is always another choice.","wo":"B: Pexe du musa jeex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPexé dou musa djékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1446,"row":{"en":"The pin up and vintage lifestyle is for everybody, regardless their age, shape and gender.","wo":"Xeetu dundu pin up ak vintage ñépp lay waxal, ngay mag wala ndaw, góor wala jigéen ak noo bindoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKheutou doundou pin up ak vintage nieup lay wakhal, ngay mag wala ndaw, goor wala djiguéne ak no bindo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1447,"row":{"en":"This story is a reminder of the dangers of drug addiction.","wo":"Jaar-jaar bii dafay fàttali nit ñi loraange yi drog mëna jur.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjar djar bii dafay fattali nitt gni lorangé yi drogue meuna diour.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1448,"row":{"en":"Listening comprehension lessons should emphasize conscious memory work.","wo":"Déglu mbir ba noppi ñu am luñu la ci laaj dafay laaj nga baña gaawa fàtte.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeglou mbir ba noppi gnou ame lougnou la ci ladj dafay ladj nga bagna gawa faté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1449,"row":{"en":"This will help to remove any dirt or grime that has been missed by the vacuum cleaner.","wo":"Loolu mooy dindi bépp mbalit wala tilim bu aspiratër bi jotul a dindi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou moy dindi beup mbalite wala tilime bou aspirateur bi diotoul a dindi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1450,"row":{"en":"Roof rails are designed to help protect passengers in the event of a rollover accident.","wo":"Piyeesu raayu kaw dañu ko dafar ngir mu ndimbalu nit ki su oto bi xalangoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPiessou rayou kaw dagnou ko defar nguir mou ndimbalou nitt ki sou auto bi khalangoo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1451,"row":{"en":"Patient: Is it serious?","wo":"Malaad bi: Dafa graaw?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMalaad bi dafa graw ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1452,"row":{"en":"Typically, equity-trading platforms cannot receive funds via credit cards.","wo":"Daanaka platform yi ñuy waxaale ay aksioŋ mënoo ci fayee ak sa kàrtu kredi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaanaka plateforme yi gnuy wakhalé ay aksion meno si fayé ak sa cartou crédit.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1453,"row":{"en":"Talk to your doctor about your symptoms and treatment options.","wo":"Waxtaan ak sa doktër ci li ngay yëg sa yaram ak xeetu paj yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWakhtane ak sa docteur si li ngay yeug sa yaram ak khettou padj yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1454,"row":{"en":"When I woke up that morning, I got dressed quickly and ate a quick breakfast.","wo":"Bima yewwoo ci suba googu, ma gaaw sol samay yéere daal di ndékki.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBima yéwo thi souba gogou, ma gaw sol samay yéré daldi ndieuki.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1455,"row":{"en":"She is not interested in finding a husband, but she does enjoy the attention of men.","wo":"Waxul dara ci am jëkkër, waaye bëgg na góor ñi diko bàyyi xel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWahoul dara thi ame dieukeur wayé beugue na goor gni diko bayi khél.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1456,"row":{"en":"When we love Jesus, we are not only showing our love for him, but we are also showing our love for God.","wo":"Sunu bëggee Jesus, noo ngi koy wan sunu mbëggeel, waaye nu ngi wanewaale sunu mbëggeel ci Yàlla.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou beugué jesus, nio ngui koy wan sougnou mbeuguel wayé nioungui wanéwalé sougnou mbeuguel ci Yalla.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1457,"row":{"en":"People see a funny picture or video, and they want to share it with their friends so that they can laugh too.","wo":"Nit ñi suñu gisee wideo wala nataal bu leen reetaanloo dañu koy yónnee seeni xarit suko defee ñu reetaan ñoom itam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNitt gni souniou guissé vidéo walla nataal bou léne réttanlo daniou koy yoné séni kharitt souko défé gnou réttane gnom itame\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1458,"row":{"en":"Dude, I'm so heartbroken right now. My girlfriend of 2 years just broke up with me.","wo":"Saa waay tay sama xol neexul. Xale bi def naa ak moom 2 at tay ñu bàyyante.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSaa way tay sama khol nekhoul. Khalé bi def naa ak mom 2 ans tay gnou bayyanté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1459,"row":{"en":"My skin looked so much smoother and younger after using it.","wo":"Bima ko defee ba noppi sama der dafa gëna nooy gëna dellu ndaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBima ko défé ba nopi sama dér dafa gueuna noyy gueuna dellou ndaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1460,"row":{"en":"The potter then uses a variety of tools to shape the clay into the desired form.","wo":"Ginaaw loolu defarkat bi jëfandikoo jumtukaay yu bari ngir génne jëmm ji mu soxla.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw lolou defar kat bi dieufandiko jumtoukay you bari nguir guéné dieum dji mou sokhla.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1461,"row":{"en":"I know what you did yesterday.","wo":"Xamnaa linga def démb.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamnaa linga def demb rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1462,"row":{"en":"Yet when you receive the same specific reply three different times, maybe it’s time to accept the answer.","wo":"Waaye soo joxe benn tontu bi ñetti yoon yu wuute, amanna defa fekk jotna nga nangu tontu boobu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé soo dioxé bene tontou bi gnetti yoon you wouté, amna déffa fek jotna nga nangou tontou bobou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1463,"row":{"en":"The woman's heart sank.","wo":"Xolu ndaw si