us.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhéwloule bou bakh laata ngay dem aéroport si boori tisbar té nga tagouwalé mauritius.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1482,"row":{"en":"What is it? I ask. I don’t know, Mum says. But I don’t think it’s friendly.","wo":"Mani, lii lan la? Sama yaay nima, xamuma ko, waaye daf may nuru lu soxor.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMane li lane la? Sama yay néma khamouma ko wayé dafmay nourou lou sokhor.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1483,"row":{"en":"We run out of the kitchen and into the living room.","wo":"Nu joge ci waañ wi daw dem ci saal bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou djogé thi wagne wi daw dem thi salle bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1484,"row":{"en":"Knowing and maintaining code is critical for maximum fire protection.","wo":"Kodu xam ak mën toppatoo dafay am solo ngir mucc bu baax ci lakk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou dou kham ak meun topato dafay ame solo nguir mouthie bou bakh si lak.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1485,"row":{"en":"Many websites offer reviews, recommendations, and detailed pricing information.","wo":"Sitweb yu bari dañuy amal jàngat, baaxe xalaat ak joxey leeral ci seeni njëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSite web you bari daniouy amal diangat bakhe khalat ak djokhey leral si seni ndieug.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1486,"row":{"en":"To schedule an appointment, please complete and submit the request form.","wo":"Ngir am ranndiw, binndal bii kayit nga yonne ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNgir ame ranndiw bindal bii kayite gua yoné ko\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1487,"row":{"en":"Be careful not to cut too short, as this can cause pain and bleeding.","wo":"Moytul dagg fu sori bamu ëpp ndax mën na metti ba noppi di nàcci.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoytoule dag fô sori bamou eup ndakh meun na meti ba nopi di nathie.\