s, vegetables, and whole grains.","wo":"Lekk regime bu sell mooy ngay lekk fruit yu bari, lujum ak pepp yu mat sëkk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLekk régime bou sell moy ngay lekk fruit you bari, lidioum ak pepp you mat seukk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1495,"row":{"en":"I was curious to see what they were, so I started reading through them.","wo":"Ma yàkkamti xam liñu ci bind, ma tàmbali leen jàng.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa yakamti kham lignou thi bind ma tambali léne diangue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1496,"row":{"en":"We believe that we have been unfairly targeted. Our building is safe and our employees are healthy.","wo":"Danu jàpp ni dañu nu teg bëtn te jaarale wuñu mbir yi ci yoon. Sunu batimaa amul benn sikk te liggéeykat yi dara dalu leen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanou diap ni daniou niou teugg beutn té diaralé wouniou mbir yi si yone. Souniou batimaa amoul benn sikk té ligueyekat yi dara dalou len.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1497,"row":{"en":"Unfortunately, elephants are threatened by habitat loss and poaching.","wo":"Waaye liy ñuul ci soow mi mooy ñay yi amatu ñu fuñu nekk, te dañu leen di ray ngir seeni béjjen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé li nioul thi sow mi moy gnay yi amatou gnou fougnou nekk té daniou len di ray nguir seni beudien.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1498,"row":{"en":"They’re actually a little sweet (unless you hit a nasty-bad bitter one).","wo":"Dañu xawa saf suukar (fileek yëyoo ci bu nëb ba wex).","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou khawa saf soukar (filek yeuyoo thi bou neub ba wekh).\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1499,"row":{"en":"soon","wo":"ci lu yàggul dara","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nci lou yaggoul dara\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}